SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This MIT license covers ONLY the contents of this repository — the measurement
harness, configuration files, plotting and analysis scripts, CSV result files,
plots, and (when published) the encoded MP4 bitstreams used to produce the
results.

This license does NOT cover the Kelvin pre-encoder itself. The Kelvin encoder,
its model weights, its network architecture, its training data, and its
training code are proprietary to Graziano Labs Corp. and are not distributed
with this repository. Access to Kelvin is offered through the EncodeIQ cloud
service under a separate commercial license; contact marco@grazianolabs.com
for pilot terms.

DATASET TERMS

The UVG and MCL-JCV datasets referenced by this benchmark are distributed
under their own terms by their original authors. See ATTRIBUTIONS.md.
